OL,3,AInside iconic horror game Silent Hill's
OL,4,AScottish makeover
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs a fan of the games, I was keen to
OL,7,Ffind out what one of the most iconic
OL,8,Fsurvival horror series looks like in
OL,9,FScotland - and whether it can live up
OL,10,Fto its legacy.
